WEBVTT

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.600
(Newt gasps)

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.160
This is the man who
tried to take my life.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:29.240
This man, who has no magic...

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.120
who would marry a witch
and pollute our blood,

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.280
create a forbidden union
that would make us less...

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.000
make us weak, like his kind.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.600
He's not alone, my friends.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:47.000
There are thousands who
seek to do the same.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:51.920
There can only be one
response to such vermin.

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:02.320
No.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:04.320
-(Queenie gasps) -(crowd cheering)

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.960
-Crucio. -(Jacob groans)

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:07.920
No!

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:10.520
(Queenie whimpering)

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.200
Make him stop!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.600
Our war with the
Muggles begins today.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.240
(crowd cheering)

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:26.960
(strained grunting)

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:28.160
(pants)

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:33.760
(grunts, panting)

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:36.120
-(sighs) -Jacob.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.120
(mystical music playing)

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:50.400
(wind whooshes)

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:16.320
(Credence) He's lying to you.

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:21.000
That creature is dead.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.160
-(crowd gasps) -(whispers) Not now.
Wait.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:35.800
(Newt) He did it to trick you.

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:38.960
He killed it and bewitched it

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:41.640
so that you might think
him worthy to lead.

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:46.000
But he doesn't want to lead you.

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.400
He just wants you to follow.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:52.240
Words.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.880
Words designed to deceive.

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:58.680
To make you doubt what you've
seen with your own two eyes.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.240
(Newt) There were two
Qilins born that night.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.480
A twin. And I know that...

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:04.920
I know that...

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.080
Because?

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:12.400
Because you have no proof.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:15.240
Because there was no second Qilin.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.880
Am I not right?

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:19.040
Its mother had been killed, it...

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:21.560
Then where is it now, Mr.
Scamander?

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.440
No one can know everything, Newt.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:49.680
Remember?

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:58.480
(suitcase opening)

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:00.240
(suspenseful music playing)

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:06.280
(Newt breathes shakily)

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:10.680
(chitters)

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:11.600
(purring)

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.120
(man) I don't get it.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.320
(ethereal music playing)

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:31.760
(Qilin trilling)

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:34.080
(Newt) She can't hear
you, little one.

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.440
(Qilin chitters)

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:36.880
Not here...

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:40.920
but perhaps somewhere
she's listening.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:46.560
(Vogel) This is the true Qilin.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:48.960
Look at it...

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:51.520
you can see it with your own eyes.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.920
-This is the true... -(crying)

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:57.880
(crowd murmurs)

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:00.400
This can't be allowed to stand.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.000
The vote must be taken again.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:05.440
Come on, Anton. Do something.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:09.280
(chitters)

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.400
(trilling)

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:31.880
(sniffing)

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:33.760
(Dumbledore) You...

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:36.000
No, no, no, please.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.400
(tender music playing)

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:42.920
(trills)

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.960
(crowd murmurs)

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:58.800
(purrs)

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.120
I'm honored.

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:06.240
But just as two of you
were born that night,

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:09.480
there's another here, equally
worthy.

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:12.640
I'm certain of it.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.560
(Qilin trills)

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:20.240
(sniffs, trills)

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:24.920
(chittering)

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:28.800
Thank you.

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.720
(chittering)

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:48.240
(breathing heavily)

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:51.040
(somber choral music playing)

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:05.080
(music intensifying)

